          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">The bearer has the Feel No Pain 4+ ability. In addition, while the bearer is leading a unit, other models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Saintly Relic: In your Command phase, if the bearer is not Battle-shocked and is within range of an objective marker you control, you gain one Miracle dice. In addition, while the bearer is on the battlefield, each time you gain a Miracle dice, you can re-roll that Miracle dice.)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
