          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">Before the battle, at the start of the Declare Battle Formations step, this unit can be split into two units, each containing five models. If you do so, one of those units must contain the model equipped with the Ministorum flamer and the other unit must contain the model equipped with the artificer-crafted storm bolter.</characteristic>
